 view. Soaring ceilings, polished concrete floors with radiant heat, expansive walls of glass and retractable corner doors create effortless indoor-outdoor living and the sensation of floating above Los Angeles. At the center of the outdoor experience is a spectacular infinity-edge pool seemingly suspended over the city below\u2014an unforgettable setting for entertaining, sunset cocktails or simply watching Los Angeles transform from daylight to a sea of lights. The multi-level floor plan combines open entertaining spaces with private retreats, while views unfold from virtually every level. A dedicated gym or executive office provides flexible additional space, and an elevator from the street-level garage adds convenience rarely found in a hillside residence. The primary suite is a private escape of its own, opening directly to the skyline and featuring a spa-inspired bath with steam shower, Japanese soaking tub and glass-enclosed shower\u2014all surrounded by extraordinary views. Built new in 2012 and offered fully furnished with curated designer interiors, this is a true turnkey opportunity for a buyer seeking something increasingly difficult to find in the Hollywood Hills: * * architectural significance, genuine privacy, dramatic views, a pool and effortless luxury in one complete property. * * Whether envisioned as a sophisticated primary residence, Los Angeles pied-\u00e0-terre, creative retreat or trophy property, 2917 Durand Drive delivers an experience that photographs cannot fully capture. * * Now offered at $3,995,000. Private showings by appointment. * *", "remarksLength": 2306, "listedBy": "Arto Poladian", "propertyTypeName": "Single Family Residential", "totalSqft": 2405, "history": [{"date": "2026-08-12", "event": "Listed", "price": 3995000, "source": "CRMLS"}, {"date": "2026-08-11", "event": "Listing Removed", "price": null, "source": "CRMLS"}, {"date": "2026-05-21", "event": "Listed", "price": 4295000, "source": "CRMLS"}, {"date": "2026-05-19", "eve